  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {洗濯物|せんたくもの}を{干|ほ}す: to hang laundry\n- {洗濯物|せんたくもの}を{取|と}り{込|こ}む: to bring in laundry\n- {洗濯物|せんたくもの}をたたむ: to fold laundry\n\nUSAGE:\nRefers to clothes in any stage of the laundry process - waiting to be washed, currently washing, or drying. In Japan, hanging laundry outside to dry is common.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {洗濯|せんたく}: laundry (action), washing\n- {物干|ものほ}し: drying rack/line",
